<title>SWEDEN: TABLE TENNIS-PERSSON WINS SCANDINAVIAN OPEN.</title>
<headline>TABLE TENNIS-PERSSON WINS SCANDINAVIAN OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-12-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the Scandinavian Open table tennis championship played in Boras on Sunday (Swedes unless stated):</p>
<p>Semifinals:</p>
<p>Jorgen Persson beat Jan-Ove Waldner 21-17 21-13 21-19 Thomas von Scheele beat Zoran Primorac (Croatia) 21-17   21-19</p>
<p>9-21 21-12</p>
<p>Final:</p>
<p>Persson beat von Scheele 21-13 21-17 21-16</p>
</text>
